        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova, Mwovosya waku, Ũla Mũtheu wa Isilaeli, ũnũkwasya: Ninyie Yeova Ngai waku, ũla ũkũmanyĩasya kwaĩla, ũla ũkũtongoeasya nzĩanĩ ĩla waĩle kũthi nayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A! Kethĩwa wethukĩĩsye mĩao yakwa! Nĩvo ĩndĩ mũuo waku wĩthĩwa wailyĩ ta ũsĩ, na ũlũngalu waku ta itulumo sya ũkanga: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.18"
